// RWZ_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1441459596" "Oh yeah.  I got him.  Take him in for questioning?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1165351580" "He was planting a UXB.  Yeah, I got him first.  Where do you want him?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2951739181" "Right.  Yeah, I got him here.  Okay.  On my way."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3868676748" "Whoa!  Freeze!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2098303096" "Stop!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_APPREHENDSUBJECTS_CAUGHT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4054062183" "Hold it right there!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_VANGUARDRIKTI_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3958771294" "Get over here and help!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_VANGUARDRIKTI_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3573020593" "Don't just stand there, help us!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BATTLE_VANGUARDRIKTI_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2800418705" "Get over here!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BIGBATTLE_VANGUARDRIKTI_ALERT_TEXT :
"P116983509" "We can't take them by ourselves, now get over here and help!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BIGBATTLE_VANGUARDRIKTI_ALERT_TEXT :
"P145839187" "Don't just stand there!  Get in here and help!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BIGBATTLE_VANGUARDRIKTI_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2885222008" "Help out!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BLUEPRINTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4019847986" "Wow...  Okay, so their stronghold is MUCH MUCH more extensive than we thought."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BLUEPRINTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2947491005" "This is not good.  We need to get troops in there to help us break down their stronghold."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BLUEPRINTS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P65843528" "Okay, I got this.  Tell Smith I need to talk to him about these."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BLUEPRINTS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2204923108" "Hey!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BLUEPRINTS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P314490475" "What are--"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_BLUEPRINTS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_CHECKPOINT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2340617292" "This place is crawling with Rikti.  Do you want the good news or the bad?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_CHECKPOINT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3611408219" "We're never really 'clear'.  There's just waves of chaos."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_CHECKPOINT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1642027847" "Only authorized personnel through here.  Check ID.  We don't know who belongs to what half the time."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_CHECKPOINT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1761849194" "No one gets through!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_CHECKPOINT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1637196508" "Keep it together, men!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2635051035" "I know this isn't exactly how Longbow envisioned the scenario to go down, but Vanguard is in charge here and we gotta work together."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1323855580" "Lady Grey was real specific on her orders.  If you have issues with how things are run here, you best speak with her."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P873811870" "I understand that.  But the bottom line is that Vanguard is the final word here.  This is a WAR ZONE, after all."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1333505212" "No, I'm not saying that.  I appreciate all the help that Longbow has provided us.  I just think we're in a tough situation so we all need to make the best of it."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3974662858" "You with me?  Let's go!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249083782" "Come on!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_VANGUARDTALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P99768709" "Not the easiest situation, that's for sure."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P881764700" "Well, all I'm saying is that there are concerns."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3024421211" "We'll do our best to help you out however you need."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P861846136" "Understood."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P745204369" "I'm here!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P130829014" "I got your back!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_COLLABORATE_FREEDOMCORPSTALK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3344441616" "Stick close!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1535678270" "Okay, I think we're in agreement here.  Good.  It's good to see the support."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3683680131" "I think we have a plan, yes?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3975767572" "Good to have you on board."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2938033009" "We're set here,  I think.  You get some volunteers and we'll execute the detail this afternoon."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2575083581" "Great.  Let's flesh this out some more and then we'll present the op to Lady Grey."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2926913128" "Got my back?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_VANGUARDTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2620855742" "Let's get to work!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3296571967" "Yeah.  I'm on board."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P496533902" "It's a good op."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_FCTALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1479733865" "Absolutely.  Let's move on it."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_FCTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2690812472" "I'm with you!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DISCREETOPS_FCTALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1512073477" "I got this!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3468231468" "You are not allowed here!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P863817002" "We got problems!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557609430" "How did you get in here?!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3544197186" "This place is crazy.  But otherwise, not too bad."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2410692905" "I'm not sure what kind of report you want.  It's madness on all corners, but my area is clear at the moment."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3509023647" "You got more recruits coming in today?  FIND some!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1806165081" "I don't care if they're from Founders Falls or Grandville -- if they're available to fight Rikti with us, we can use 'em!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4041258083" "Get moving!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249993822" "Stick together!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3712759911" "Take 'em down at the knees!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1493263294" "Okay, so we have a tough situation.  We've got heroes and villains fighting together so there's bound to be conflicts, even if they can't attack each other.  You guys need to keep it under control."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3276104064" "We set the example.  Got me?  If we can't create a sense of cohesion with Longbow then this will not work.  Got me?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4220565656" "I don't care WHAT your opinions.  If they do not help this operation, they do not leave your lips.  Got me?"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1770795999" "Deal with this!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557994292" "Let's go, men!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_LEADER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2215929597" "Get to work!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3413019834" "Well, we warned them, didn't we?  How long?  No one listened.  And now we've come to this."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2172268669" "I can't stand this place.  I'd wipe every last Rikti from this place if I could.  Did you see those engineers or whatever they are?  Working on the ship UNDER that shield.  We need to take it down.  At least keep them from further repairs."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1034791271" "According to my CO, they're some kind of pylon.  I don't know.  I think they power the shield or act as a warning or something."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P814686142" "Yeah, he ended up in the infirmary when the UXB went off.  He didn't know what it was."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3336743419" "We're not alone.  Let's go!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3833113806" "Back to work!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3096546998" "Break's over!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1322683016" "We won't get more than fifteen feet before something is going to jump us.  Just warning you guys now."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3871863353" "Cleaning crews are so pointless here.  The Rikti just blow everything up anyway."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3274153201" "I don't know what to tell you.  This is not the safest detail so keep alert and stick close."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2702193173" "Time to shine!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1191774404" "I got something here!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1308552400" "Over here!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_HEAVY_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
